# Thorough gate (~30s). Runs once per push instead of once per commit, which
# is the only reason it can afford to be this slow.
#
# Confirms package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml agree. Vercel installs with a frozen
# lockfile, so a drift caught here is a deploy that would have failed remotely.
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

pnpm test
pnpm build

# Dead-code report. Warning-only by design (`--no-exit-code`), so it never
# blocks a push — it just makes the rot visible before it ships.
pnpm deadcode
